    "operational": "Carries nothing about a person: a time, a count, a state, or the club's own configuration."
  },
  "lifecycles": {
    "roster-record": "Ends when the club removes the person; a departed member is deactivated rather than erased.",
    "account-cascade": "Removed with the account it belongs to, by ON DELETE CASCADE.",
    "session-cleanup": "Swept on the cadence of COURTSIDE_SESSION_CLEANUP_CRON, which may be widened but not switched off.",
    "booking-pseudonymisation": "Pseudonymised by the scheduled deletion job some months after season end; the utilisation survives, the personal reference does not.",
    "preview-retention": "Bounded by COURTSIDE_IMPORT_PREVIEW_RETENTION and enforced by a scheduled sweep.",
    "import-record": "Kept for as long as the source is configured; it records that an import happened and against which member number.",
    "append-only-log": "Never rewritten. Removing the person the id names is what makes the entry anonymous.",
    "publication-registry": "Deleted once its consumers finish, so nothing accumulates for a job to clean up.",
    "attempt-window": "Replaced when the next attempt window opens.",
    "club-configuration": "Lives as long as the club keeps it; a board changes it in the product and no person's lifecycle reaches it."
  },
